      "side": 1,
      "message": "In light of recent discussions, a good host will not clear context without clearing pasid entries first. So this patch is obsolete from the functionality perspective.\n\nFrom the security perspective, doing a validation that no pasid entris are present during context clear and returning -EBUSY if yes, seems a good and an easy solution, will implement that.",
